MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The WYZE Cam v3 feels like a useful next choice because I have bought home security cameras, and its color night vision could improve coverage if I can provide wired power.",
    "The Echo Show 8 fits my interest in connected home devices while adding a screen and video calling that give me a new reason to choose it."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "More Fire TV players offer little immediate benefit because I already have a 4K stick and a Fire TV television; an HD stick would be especially unnecessary.",
    "The smart plug, Echo Auto, and AirPods Pro do not address a current need: I have no appliance in mind to automate and am not looking for car assistance or personal audio."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as a reason to keep offering streaming players, even though those purchases already meet my viewing needs.",
    "Alexa compatibility seems to count too heavily on its own; a device still needs to do something useful for me at home."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "I care about what a device adds beyond what I already own, such as better camera visibility or a screen for video calling.",
    "Similar products are alternatives for me: I would favor the v3 over the v2 and the Echo Show over the Echo Dot, with wired power availability affecting my camera choice."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my home viewing and monitoring interests but give too much weight to familiar devices without enough attention to added usefulness."
}
